{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RemovedComponents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9ComponentP","text":"Component","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The collection holds each entity that lost a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"type":"text","text":", whether the component was removed or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entity despawned, oldest first. The following system scores a point for each entity that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"thawed:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["@System","struct CountThawed {","    func run(_ thawed: RemovedComponents<Frozen>, _ score: ResourceWriter<Score>) {","        score.value.points += thawed.count","    }","}","","var world = World()","world.resources.insert(Score(points: 0))","let statue = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Frozen())","let frame = Schedule { CountThawed() }","frame.run(on: &world)","","world.remove(Frozen.self, from: statue)","frame.run(on: &world)","print(world.resources[Score.self].points)","\/\/ Prints \"1\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The schedule starts recording removals of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/trackRemovals(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before the system first runs, so removals before then aren’t listed. Removals are kept as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"events are; see "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/EventReader"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/RemovedComponents"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Systems"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Systems\/SystemParameters.swift#L357","fileName":"SystemParameters.swift"},"role":"symbol","title":"RemovedComponents","externalID":"s:7Systems17RemovedComponentsV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RemovedComponents","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RemovedComponents"}]},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/RemovedComponents\/endIndex","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/RemovedComponents\/removals","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/RemovedComponents\/startIndex"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"generated":true,"title":"Subscripts","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/RemovedComponents\/subscript(_:)"],"anchor":"Subscripts"},{"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/RemovedComponents\/BidirectionalCollection-Implementations","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/RemovedComponents\/Collection-Implementations","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/RemovedComponents\/RandomAccessCollection-Implementations","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentat